odde_sampler.py, odde_apb_bind.py: the sampler's two attention sites (the DiffusionTransformer's AttentionPairBias modules and the atom transformers'
  windowed attention) bound to the shared core's pair-bias-attention provider (opt_core.kernels.apb); no attention kernel is included here.
third_party/opendde_fpf_ditfast: fused DiffusionTransformer / AtomTransformer block schedules and the conditioning de-duplication, bound to OpenDDE's
  modules (its NOTICE inside); the row kernels it launches are the shared core's (opt_core.kernels.apb.ditfast).
